{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object found, approach it. Then grab it, move to destination, take and check it. Finally, process it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = FindObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectShape    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />",
